    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling adventure with <strong>Claudinho</strong>, a brave little cloud fighting to protect the Amazon Rainforest from wildfires!<br><strong>A Clareira</strong> is a colorful 2D <strong>shoot 'em up</strong> game where you throw raindrops to put out fires and overcome obstacles across increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Lovingly crafted by local artists, featuring visuals inspired by the Amazon\u2019s unique wildlife, plants, and culture;<br>\u2605 Simple and intuitive gameplay with progressive difficulty that challenges reflexes and strategy;<br>\u2605 Packed with environmental facts to raise awareness in a fun and educational way;<br>\u2605 Perfect for all ages \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Claudinho and help protect the forest \u2014 do you have what it takes?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling adventure with <strong>Claudinho</strong>, a brave little cloud fighting to protect the Amazon Rainforest from wildfires!<br><strong>A Clareira</strong> is a colorful 2D <strong>shoot 'em up</strong> game where you throw raindrops to put out fires and overcome obstacles across increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Lovingly crafted by local artists, featuring visuals inspired by the Amazon\u2019s unique wildlife, plants, and culture;<br>\u2605 Simple and intuitive gameplay with progressive difficulty that challenges reflexes and strategy;<br>\u2605 Packed with environmental facts to raise awareness in a fun and educational way;<br>\u2605 Perfect for all ages \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Claudinho and help protect the forest \u2014 do you have what it takes?</p>",
    "short_description": "Help Claudinho save the rainforest! A Clareira is a 2D arcade-style Shoot 'em Up with a touch of bullet hell. Play as a brave little cloud putting out wildfires to protect the Amazon. \u201cClareira\u201d means the heart of the forest \u2014 and it needs you!",
